  "health_html": "<style>\n  .wk-fig { margin: 6px 0 30px; padding: 18px 6px;\n            background: rgba(14,28,51,.55); border: 1px solid rgba(88,116,152,.28);\n            border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; }\n  .wk-take { color: #96a8be; font: 400 15px/1.6 var(--sans);\n             margin: -14px 0 30px; }\n  .wk-health { display: flex; gap: 30px; align-items: center;\n               flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 4px 0 14px; padding: 20px;\n               background: rgba(14,28,51,.55); border: 1px solid rgba(88,116,152,.28);\n               border-radius: 16px; }\n  .wk-gauge { flex: 0 0 260px; }\n  .wk-pillars { flex: 1 1 340px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n                gap: 14px; }\n  .wk-pill-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\n                 align-items: baseline; }\n  .wk-pill-name { color: #f4f7fa; font: 600 14px/1.3 var(--sans); }\n  .wk-pill-val { color: #e9b949; font: 700 15px/1 var(--mono); }\n  .wk-pill-track { height: 8px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 5px 0 4px;\n                   background: rgba(88,116,152,.28); overflow: hidden; }\n  .wk-pill-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 6px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(90deg,#bf9534,#e9b949); }\n  .wk-pill-cap { color: #96a8be; font: 400 12px/1.4 var(--sans); }\n  .wk-drag { color: #f4f7fa; font: 400 15px/1.6 var(--sans) !important;\n             margin: 4px 0 14px; text-shadow: none !important; }\n  .wk-drag strong { color: #e85a5e; }\n  .wk-legend { margin: 4px 0 30px; padding: 14px 16px; background: rgba(14,28,51,.55);\n               border: 1px solid rgba(88,116,152,.28); border-radius: 12px; }\n  .wk-legend-h { color: #e9b949; font: 700 11px/1 var(--mono);\n                 letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;\n                 margin-bottom: 7px; }\n  .wk-legend-body { color: #96a8be; font: 400 14px/1.6 var(--sans) !important;\n                    margin: 0 0 10px; text-shadow: none !important; }\n  .wk-bands { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px; }\n  .wk-band { color: #96a8be; font: 400 12px/1 var(--sans);\n             background: rgba(88,116,152,.28); border-radius: 999px; padding: 5px 10px;\n             white-space: nowrap; }\n  .wk-band b { color: #f4f7fa; font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 700; }\n  .wk-trans { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0;\n              margin: 4px 0 30px; }\n  .wk-tr { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 22px auto;\n           gap: 10px; align-items: center; padding: 11px 2px;\n           border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(88,116,152,.28); }\n  .wk-tr-what { color: #96a8be; font: 400 14px/1.4 var(--sans); }\n  .wk-tr-a { color: #5b7292; font: 600 14px/1 var(--mono);\n             text-align: right; }\n  .wk-tr-arw { color: #e9b949; text-align: center; }\n  .wk-tr-b { color: #f4f7fa; font: 700 14px/1 var(--mono); }\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .wk-health { gap: 16px; } .wk-gauge { flex-basis: 100%; text-align: center; }\n  }\n</style><div class=\"mib-health-card\"><div class=\"wk-health\"><div class=\"wk-gauge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 260 208\" width=\"260\" role=\"img\">\n  <path d=\"M 34 150 A 96 96 0 0 1 226 150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(88,116,152,.28)\" stroke-width=\"14\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 34.0 150.0 A 96 96 0 0 1 133.0 54.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e9b949\" stroke-width=\"14\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n  <text x=\"130\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f4f7fa\" font-family=\"var(--serif),Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"58\" font-weight=\"400\">51</text>\n  <text x=\"130\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e9b949\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace\" font-size=\"13\" letter-spacing=\"3\">TIRING</text>\n</svg></div><div class=\"wk-pillars\"><div class=\"wk-pill\"><div class=\"wk-pill-top\"><span class=\"wk-pill-name\">Participation</span><span class=\"wk-pill-val\">31</span></div><div class=\"wk-pill-track\"><div class=\"wk-pill-fill\" style=\"width:31%\"></div></div><div class=\"wk-pill-cap\">share of stocks actually rising</div></div><div class=\"wk-pill\"><div class=\"wk-pill-top\"><span class=\"wk-pill-name\">Breadth</span><span class=\"wk-pill-val\">86</span></div><div class=\"wk-pill-track\"><div class=\"wk-pill-fill\" style=\"width:86%\"></div></div><div class=\"wk-pill-cap\">how often the broad market confirmed the index</div></div><div class=\"wk-pill\"><div class=\"wk-pill-top\"><span class=\"wk-pill-name\">Leadership</span><span class=\"wk-pill-val\">44</span></div><div class=\"wk-pill-track\"><div class=\"wk-pill-fill\" style=\"width:44%\"></div></div><div class=\"wk-pill-cap\">how many names carry the upside</div></div><div class=\"wk-pill\"><div class=\"wk-pill-top\"><span class=\"wk-pill-name\">Risk Appetite</span><span class=\"wk-pill-val\">62</span></div><div class=\"wk-pill-track\"><div class=\"wk-pill-fill\" style=\"width:62%\"></div></div><div class=\"wk-pill-cap\">offense vs defense, fear gauge, mood stability</div></div><div class=\"wk-pill\"><div class=\"wk-pill-top\"><span class=\"wk-pill-name\">Cross Asset</span><span class=\"wk-pill-val\">31</span></div><div class=\"wk-pill-track\"><div class=\"wk-pill-fill\" style=\"width:31%\"></div></div><div class=\"wk-pill-cap\">are stocks, crypto and commodities telling one story?</div></div></div></div><p class=\"wk-drag\"><strong>Biggest drag:</strong> Participation — 32% of stocks rising at the start, 16% at the end (week average 46%), so the week&#x27;s gains rested on fewer and fewer stocks, and a narrow advance is the kind that breaks hard.</p><div class=\"wk-legend\"><div class=\"wk-legend-h\">How to read this</div><p class=\"wk-legend-body\">One score, 0–100, built from five things a healthy market needs at once. Higher means the advance is broader, calmer and better backed by the tape.</p><div class=\"wk-bands\"><span class=\"wk-band\"><b>70+</b> Healthy</span><span class=\"wk-band\"><b>55–69</b> Steady</span><span class=\"wk-band\"><b>40–54</b> Tiring</span><span class=\"wk-band\"><b>25–39</b> Divergent</span><span class=\"wk-band\"><b>&lt;25</b> Stressed</span></div></div></div>",
